duct, key features, and what problem it solves...\",\"English Description\",\"Chinese Description\",\"Select at least one topic\",\"I am the creator of this product\",\"Mark as product creator to showcase your work\",\"This is an indie hacker project\",\"Showcase the innovative spirit of indie developers\",{\"_669\":1487,\"_671\":1488,\"_673\":1489,\"_675\":1490,\"_677\":1491,\"_679\":1492,\"_681\":1493,\"_683\":1494,\"_685\":1495,\"_687\":1496,\"_689\":1497,\"_691\":1498,\"_693\":1499,\"_695\":1500,\"_697\":1501,\"_699\":1502,\"_701\":1503,\"_703\":1504,\"_705\":1505,\"_707\":1506},\"Free Submission\",\"Add the Xinquji badge to your website and verify to publish. Get 1 dofollow backlink.\",\"Priority Submission\",\"Recommended\",\"Skip badge verification, priority review, and homepage placement\",\"To verify ownership, add the Xinquji badge to your website. Embed the code below, then click \\\"Verify Badge\\\".\",\"Verify Badge\",\"Verifying...\",\"Re-verify\",\"Verified — ready to submit\",\"Verification required before submitting\",\"Verified! Xinquji badge detected.\",\"No Xinquji link detected on your website. Please add the badge or link first.\",\"Verification failed, please try again\",\"Priority Submission Benefits\",\"Skip website badge verification\",\"Priority review, live within 24 hours\",\"Homepage featured placement for 3 days\",\"Pay $19 to Publish\",\"Submission will be automatically sent for review after payment\",{\"_711\":1508,\"_713\":1509,\"_229\":1258,\"_237\":1510,\"_239\":1263},\"Clear Form\",\"Are you sure you want to clear all form content? This cannot be undone.\",\"Publish Now\",{\"_718\":1512,\"_720\":1513,\"_722\":1514,\"_724\":1515,\"_726\":1516,\"_728\":1517,\"_730\":1518,\"_732\":1519,\"_734\":1520,\"_736\":1521,\"_738\":1522,\"_740\":1523,\"_742\":1524,\"_744\":1525},\"Product name is required\",\"Tagline must be at least 5 characters\",\"At least one URL is required\",\"At least one topic is required\",\"Please upload a product thumbnail\",\"Please complete badge verification first by adding a Xinquji link to your website\",\"Please enter the product URL first\",\"Image size cannot exceed 2MB\",\"Some images exceed 2MB, please reselect\",\"Thumbnail upload failed, please try again\",\"Image upload failed, please try again\",\"Submission failed, please try again\",\"Fetch failed, please try again\",\"Please enter an App Store URL\",{\"_325\":1527,\"_499\":1528,\"_297\":1529,\"_751\":1530,\"_245\":1531},\"Quick Fill\",\"Enter an App Store URL to auto-fill the form\",\"App Store URL\",\"Please enter the full App Store product URL\",\"Fill\",{\"_325\":1533,\"_499\":1534,\"_600\":1535,\"_602\":1536,\"_613\":1542,\"_709\":1546,\"_716\":1549},\"Edit Product\",\"Update your product information.\",\"Update Failed\",{\"_606\":1537,\"_760\":1538,\"_543\":1539,\"_141\":1540,\"_764\":1541},\"1. Basic Info\",\"2. Media\",\"3. Description\",\"4. Additional Options\",\"5. Embed Badge\",{\"_17\":1465,\"_623\":1466,\"_625\":1467,\"_631\":1469,\"_604\":1461,\"_633\":1470,\"_767\":1543,\"_637\":1544,\"_639\":1545,\"_641\":1474,\"_643\":1475,\"_645\":1476,\"_647\":1477,\"_649\":1478,\"_567\":1432,\"_652\":1479,\"_65\":1313,\"_658\":1481,\"_660\":1482,\"_662\":1483,\"_664\":1484,\"_666\":1485},\"Upload\",\"Recommended: 240x240px\",\"JPG, PNG. Max 2MB.\",{\"_229\":1258,\"_772\":1547,\"_774\":1548},\"Update Product\",\"Updating...\",{\"_718\":1512,\"_720\":1513,\"_722\":1514,\"_724\":1515,\"_726\":1516,\"_732\":1519,\"_734\":1520,\"_736\":1521,\"_738\":1522,\"_777\":1550},\"Update failed, please try again\",{\"_325\":1447,\"_781\":1552,\"_263\":1553,\"_784\":1554,\"_786\":1555,\"_788\":1556,\"_790\":1557,\"_792\":1558,\"_794\":1559,\"_796\":1560,\"_798\":1561,\"_800\":1562,\"_802\":1563,\"_804\":1564,\"_806\":1565,\"_808\":1566,\"_810\":1567,\"_812\":1568,\"_592\":1494,\"_594\":1569,\"_814\":1570,\"_816\":1533,\"_817\":1571,\"_819\":1572,\"_821\":1573},\"Back to product\",\"Please log in to claim this product\",\"Log in to get the badge code and claim your product.\",\"Log in\",\"If\",\" is your product, complete the 3 steps below to claim it. Once claimed, you can edit the product info.\",\"After claiming and adding the badge, your site gets a dofollow link from Xinquji — great for SEO.\",\"Get the badge code\",\"Add the code below to your website\",\"page. It includes a link to Xinquji.\",\"Add the badge to your site\",\"We will check the following site for the Xinquji badge:\",\"Site to check\",\"This product has no website link yet, so it can't be claimed right now.\",\"Verify \u0026 claim\",\"Once the badge is on your site, click the button below. We'll verify automatically and complete the claim.\",\"Verify \u0026 Claim\",\"Claimed! You can now edit this product.\",\"View Product\",\"You have claimed this product.\",\"You can edit the product info, and the badge link is live.\",\"This product has been claimed by someone else.\",{\"_824\":1575,\"_536\":1582,\"_851\":1592},{\"_497\":1576,\"_827\":1314,\"_325\":1577,\"_499\":1578,\"_830\":1579,\"_832\":1580,\"_834\":1581,\"_428\":1355},\"Community\",\"Community Articles\",\"Explore in-depth reviews, developer interviews, and industry insights.\",\"Latest Articles\",\"This Week's Picks\",\"In-depth reviews and insights from the community\",{\"_837\":1583,\"_233\":1260,\"_839\":1584,\"_840\":1585,\"_550\":1588,\"_156\":1589},\"Back to Articles\",\"Article\",{\"_842\":1586,\"_844\":1587},\"Pending Review\",\"Rejected\",{\"_325\":1421,\"_553\":1268,\"_251\":1269,\"_554\":1422},{\"_848\":1590,\"_814\":1570,\"_283\":1591},\"Products Mentioned\",\"No linked products\",{\"_853\":1324,\"_854\":1593,\"_856\":1594,\"_858\":1595,\"_237\":1262,\"_239\":1263,\"_241\":1264,\"_860\":1596,\"_862\":1597,\"_866\":1600,\"_613\":1605,\"_881\":1609,\"_716\":1614},\"Edit Article\",\"Share your insights, reviews, or behind-the-scenes stories.\",\"Edit your article content.\",\"Saving...\",{\"_325\":1598,\"_562\":1599},\"Publish Quality Content\"